{"run_id":"run_87a3747cebd5","schema_version":"0.1","seq":8,"t_ms":8,"text":"I haven't opened the ticket yet, because the register doesn't say which template applies to carrier agreements.\n\nThe register at /legal/contract_templates_2026.md only lists:\n- The master services agreement template, at version 4\n- The data processing addendum, at version 2\n\nIt says the register records which type of counterparty each template applies to, but that mapping isn't actually in the file. Nothing in it mentions carriers. A ticket \"confirming\" a version would just be a guess.\n\nI can do one of these:\n1. Open the finance-review ticket saying the register doesn't specify the carrier template, and ask Operations or counsel to confirm it. (I'd note that the master services agreement is at version 4 and the data processing addendum at version 2.)\n2. Search the corporate documents or contracts workspace for the carrier template mapping first, then file the ticket.\n\nWhich would you like?","turn":2,"type":"agent.message"}
